<title>GERMANY: Vereins - und Westbank net profit down.</title>
<headline>Vereins - und Westbank net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     66.1  down 2.2 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend					 12     vs 12 marks</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total			  27,700 up 8.0 pct</p>
<p>    Business volume				28,100 up 8.6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Vereins- und Westbank AG, a subsidiary of Bayerische Vereinsbank AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
